  "notes": "Basis: manifest says modified cash; statements are titled cash basis, so basis=cash. Governmental = Total column of governmental funds receipts/disbursements statement (p4); business-type = Total column of proprietary funds revenues/expenses (p6, water and sewer). Cash-basis proprietary statement has no explicit receipt/disbursement totals, so business-type totals were added up (see computed). Governmental interest income 2,133.49 is printed below Total Disbursements under Other Financing Sources, recorded as a receipt with outside_printed_total. Transfers in/out 7,590.60 (General in, Keno out) net to zero in the total column. Beginning/ending cash for governmental = fund balance of cash-basis statement. Balance sheet = Statement of Net Position Cash Basis total column (p1, includes governmental + proprietary). Page 10 comparative statement repeats p4 and was not used for detail. Detail uses the all-funds budget schedule (p9) only; it mixes governmental and business-type funds, so revenue lines are tagged governmental with review and expenditure lines tagged by function. Trimmed PDF has 10 pages (manifest 32 = original page count); the Cash flow statement (p7-8, proprietary, cash basis) was not used except for confirmation. Read pages 1-10 of 10."
